# This repo didn't have a .gitignore before — added minimally, alongside
# the apps/*/weights/ convention (see apps/games/2048/NOTES.md), rather
# than as a general cleanup. Feel free to extend.

# Per-app "production" weights directories are tracked (e.g.
# apps/games/2048/weights/*.npy — see tools/promote_weights.py), but the
# local single-slot rollback backup inside them is deliberately NOT: it's
# a pre-commit safety net, not history — git itself is the real history
# once a promoted set of weights is actually committed. Committing
# .previous/ too would make every promote+commit produce a redundant
# extra copy of whatever was already in the previous commit.
**/weights/.previous/
